\ A field's target substituted by an earlier split (plan row TB2, piece E;
\ the Forth review of slice E1, finding 8, probe p27): obtain's Nat
\ split of x reverts hx : 2 ∣ x and introduces it again, so the tuple for
\ hx (Dvd.dvd on Nat unfolds to an Exists) must be matched on the new
\ hypothesis (rcases.fs's rcs-first applies the substitution; fault
\ fsubst-not-applied).

\ Lean: theorem dv_obtain (h : Exists (Dvd.dvd (Nat.succ (Nat.succ Nat.zero)))) : True := by
\         obtain ⟨_ | n, c, hc⟩ := h
\         trivial
\         trivial
theorem dv_obtain
  ' Dvd.dvd ' Nat.succ ' Nat.succ Nat.zero $ $ $ Exists explicit: h
  True
:= by
  ' h by-obtain[ << _ | n c hc >> ]
  by-trivial
  by-trivial
end dv_obtain
